      "claim": "No traffic-data record was attached for this trip: EV-ADVIS-05064-01 is MISSING and carries weight 0.0, an absence that is itself citable but carries no fact. The record therefore offers no external explanation — congestion, diversion or otherwise — for the 12-minute hole in the driver's trace across the arrival marker and the waiting window.",
      "side": "RIDER",
      "reason_code": "IMPAIRMENT_UNDISCLOSED",
      "detail": "the claim cites impaired artifact EV-ADVIS-05064-01 at weight_multiplier 0.0 but does not name its issue code(s): MISSING_ARTIFACT"
    },
