      "claim": "The rider's account has no electronic support while the driver's does. The GPS artifact contains no rider track at all — rider_track is empty — so nothing in the record places the rider at the pickup during the waiting window, and the chat log shows both driver messages were delivered and read by the rider (15:43:03 and 15:46:43) yet the rider never replied and never answered the 25-second call. A rider genuinely standing at the pickup who could not see the car would have answered or replied.",
